extends ../layouts/main

block content
  main(class='mb-8')
    section(class='rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-50 to-white p-10 shadow-lg ring-1 ring-slate-200 flex flex-col items-center text-center')
      p(class='text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-indigo-600 mb-2') Tailwind CSS
      h1(class='text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-4 drop-shadow') Welcome to Node.js Practices
      p(class='mb-6 text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-xl')
        | This home page is built with Express, Pug, and Tailwind CSS. Explore modern Node.js web development with beautiful UI and best practices.
      if user && user.name
        span(class='text-lg font-semibold text-green-700 mb-4') Hi, #{user.name} - #{user.role}!
        if user.role === 'admin'
          a(class='mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-purple-600 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow transition hover:bg-purple-700', href='/admin/posts')
            | Go to Admin Dashboard
      else
        div(class='flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center')
          a(class='rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-6 py-2 text-white font-semibold shadow transition hover:bg-indigo-700', href='/about') About
          a(class='rounded-lg bg-green-500 px-6 py-2 text-white font-semibold shadow transition hover:bg-green-600', href='/users/login') Login
          a(class='rounded-lg bg-gray-500 px-6 py-2 text-white font-semibold shadow transition hover:bg-gray-600', href='/users/register') Register

  section(class='grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-12')
    div(class='block bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-100 to-gray-200 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md flex flex-col items-center')
      h2(class='text-xl font-bold text-indigo-700 mb-2') Node.js
      p(class='text-gray-700 text-center') A JavaScript runtime built on Chrome's V8 JavaScript engine.
    div(class='block bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-100 to-gray-200 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md flex flex-col items-center')
      h2(class='text-xl font-bold text-indigo-700 mb-2') Express.js
      p(class='text-gray-700 text-center') A minimal and flexible Node.js web application framework that provides a robust set of features for web and mobile applications.
    div(class='block bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-100 to-gray-200 p-6 rounded-xl shadow-md flex flex-col items-center')
      h2(class='text-xl font-bold text-indigo-700 mb-2') Pug
      p(class='text-gray-700 text-center') A high-performance template engine heavily influenced by Haml and implemented with JavaScript for Node.js and browsers.
